config BR2_PACKAGE_FIRMWARE_TROGDOR_MODEM
	bool "firmware-trogdor-modem"
	help
	  Firmware for the modem of Qualcomm SC7180 (trogdor) Chromebooks
	  without LTE: mba.mbn and qdsp6sw.mbn under
	  qcom/sc7180-trogdor/modem-nolte, as the trogdor device tree names
	  them. The modem hosts the Wi-Fi's firmware service, so without it
	  there is no Wi-Fi. ChromeOS's build, which linux-firmware does not
	  carry; taken from Cadmium's firmware collection.

	  https://github.com/CadmiumLinux/firmware
